  m_text: 'Just for clarification, a lot of people confuse this game with a very
    popular fan game, so if you think this is a top down shooter, you''re in the
    wrong game, this is a puzzler.

    If game is too big for your computer to handle,
    there is a lite version that downs the size from 500 megabytes to only 100 megabytes!

    To
    download the game, right click the download script and run it through any program
    that can run javass (if you don''t have one, you can download one in www.google.com)'
